`\n\nThis Ansible Playbook will perform the specified tasks to deploy Cadvisor. It creates the necessary directories, downloads the Cadvisor binary, propagates the binary from a local directory, creates a symbolic link, generates the systemd service file, checks the service status, prints the status for debugging, enables the service, starts the service, and ensures it is in the started state. The handlers restart the service if it was running before the playbook was executed.' additional_kwargs={} response_metadata={'model': 'llama3.1:8b', 'created_at': '2025-10-11T15:00:39.791383134Z', 'done': True, 'done_reason': 'stop', 'total_duration': 6061013919, 'load_duration': 117335424, 'prompt_eval_count': 733, 'prompt_eval_duration': 165645616, 'eval_count': 587, 'eval_duration': 5777000297, 'model_name': 'llama3.1:8b'} id='run--428efbee-8dd0-437c-8a74-a27177258670-0' usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 733, 'output_tokens': 587, 'total_tokens': 1320}
