content='Here is the corrected YAML playbook:\n\n```\n---\n- name: Import assert.yml\n  include_tasks: assert.yml\n  delegate_to: localhost\n  run_once: true\n\n- name: Install python pip\n  apt:\n    name: "{{ python_pip_packages }}"\n    state: \'present\'\n\n- name: Configure pip proxy\n  template:\n    src: templates/pip.conf.j2\n    dest: /etc/pip.conf\n    mode: \'0644\'\n  when: python_pip_proxy is defined\n  notify: restart pip\n\n- name: Trust hosts\n  template:\n    src: templates/pip.conf.j2\n    dest: /etc/pip.conf\n    mode: \'0644\'\n  when: python_pip_trusted_host is defined\n  notify: restart pip\n\n- name: Update pip\n  pip:\n    name: "{{ python_pip_pip_package }}"\n    state: "{{ python_pip_pip_state }}"\n    executable: "{{ python_pip_executable }}"\n    skip_if_unavailable: yes\n  when: python_pip_pip_package is defined\n\n- name: Install requested modules\n  pip:\n    name: "{{ item.name }}"\n    state: "{{ item.state | default(\'present\') }}"\n    version: "{{ item.version | default(\'\') }}"\n    executable: "{{ python_pip_executable }}"\n    skip_if_unavailable: yes\n  loop: "{{ python_pip_modules }}"\n  loop_control:\n    label: "{{ item.name }}"\n  when: python_pip_modules is defined\n```\n\nThe corrections made were:\n\n1. In the `Install requested modules` task, the `when` condition was moved to the task level, as the `loop` and `loop_control` directives do not support a `when` condition. The `when` condition is now applied to the entire task.\n2. In the `Update pip` task, the `when` condition was corrected to check if `python_pip_pip_package` is defined, as intended.' additional_kwargs={} response_metadata={'model': 'llama3.1:8b', 'created_at': '2025-10-11T16:00:13.265799636Z', 'done': True, 'done_reason': 'stop', 'total_duration': 5660141374, 'load_duration': 105805951, 'prompt_eval_count': 1066, 'prompt_eval_duration': 25909317, 'eval_count': 413, 'eval_duration': 5527365167, 'model_name': 'llama3.1:8b'} id='run--8d590219-fe62-4683-b